WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.500
[Quiet, plucked melody]

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.420
[Bellwick’s bell rings]

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.050
[The bell answers from across the veil]

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.810
[The Echo Chime rings]

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.420
[Two brass receivers ring]

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.690
[Chime and sword strikes]

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:21.740
[The bells resolve into a bright chord]
